      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1340827359,
      "text": "Amelanchier arborea, is a small tree native to eastern North America from the Gulf Coast north to Thunder Bay in Ontario and Lake St. John in Quebec, and west to Texas and Minnesota."
    },
